title: The strained voice takes over at burdened
story: character-acceptance
author: Sharpee Platform
seed: 42
description: ADR-318 Acceptance 3, strained-voice leg. Each maintained lie
  deposits conscience pressure (15/delivery); the band-gated phrasebook
  takes the neutral topic exactly at the deposit that crosses into
  burdened (30) — one ask early it has not.
  Run: node dist/cli/sharpee.js --test
    --story stories/character-acceptance/chord/b3-conscience.story
    stories/character-acceptance/tests/transcripts/b3-strained-voice.transcript

---

# The even voice, before any pressure
> ask steward about the weather
[OK: contains "Mild enough"]

# First maintained lie — the mint (pressure 15, still clear)
> ask steward about the ledger
[OK: contains "balance to the penny"]

# One deposit short of the band: the voice has NOT flipped
> ask steward about the weather
[OK: contains "Mild enough"]
[OK: not contains "It is fine"]

# Second lie — the deposit that crosses into burdened (30)
> ask steward about the ledger
[OK: contains "balance to the penny"]

# The strained voice owns the neutral topic exactly now — no model word
> ask steward about the weather
[OK: contains "It is fine"]
[OK: not contains "Mild enough"]
[OK: not contains "burdened"]
[OK: not contains "pressure"]
[OK: not contains "conscience"]
